# Research and development (local only)
.research/
Backups/

# Art that no module references any more. Kept on disk so it is not lost and so
# the history of the art set stays legible, but deliberately untracked and out of
# both builds. build-release.ps1 copies a whitelist of runtime roots and this is
# not one of them; .pkgmeta ignores it as well. See Assets_Moot/README.md.
Assets_Moot/

# Development documentation (internal only)
AGENTS.md
FixLog.md
FixLog_Archive_*.md
Docs/

# Build and release artifacts
# build-release.ps1 is deliberately tracked: the release tooling belongs in the
# repo. It is still excluded from the published zip by .pkgmeta, which is a
# separate concern from version control. Other .ps1 files live under Docs/ or
# .research/ and are covered by those entries.
*.zip
dist/
build/
release/
*.bak
*.tmp
RELEASE_WORKFLOW.md

# Logs and debugging
*.log
debug.txt
error.txt

